OL,3,GNEWSAGas leak shuts Reading-Didcot
OL,4,AParkway rail line
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gas leak has closed a railway line
OL,7,Fwith no trains running between Didcot
OL,8,FParkway and Reading.
OL,10,FSevere disruption is expected to
OL,11,Flong-distance trains through Didcot,
OL,12,FOxfordshire, and any services that are
OL,13,Frunning are likely to be very busy.
OL,14,FNetwork Rail is urging passengers not
OL,15,Fto travel between Reading in Berkshire
OL,16,Fand Swindon in Wiltshire.
OL,18,FRail passengers can use their tickets
OL,19,Fon other train operators and buses.
OL,20,FAnyone who no longer wants to travel on
OL,21,FWednesday can apply for a refund or use
OL,22,Ftheir tickets on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
