OL,3,GNEWSAGas leak shuts Reading-Didcot
OL,4,AParkway rail line
OL,5,
OL,6,FGas distribution firm SGN said
OL,7,Fengineers were working to repair the
OL,8,Fgas leak in Didcot's Ladygrove area
OL,9,Fafter a third party damaged the gas
OL,10,Fnetwork.
